*.local.json

# Type declarations Claude Code writes beside a mod each time it loads it - generated, ~14k lines.
.claude/skills/*/.claude-plugin/types/

# Ad-hoc task records (project-memory/tasks/) hold real business data - report
# queries, customer names, sample output - and this repo is a public template.
# They sync with the drive instead. Only the convention file ships.
project-memory/tasks/*
!project-memory/tasks/_README.md
